# Scenario 04: Multi-Instance Resource Reduction Matrix Deadlock
MODE detection
PREVENTION none
VICTIM_POLICY fewest

RESOURCE Disk 2
RESOURCE GPU 1
RESOURCE Net 1

PROCESS DB_Proc 3 20.0
PROCESS AI_Model 2 15.0
PROCESS Backup_Daemon 1 2.0

CLAIM DB_Proc 1 1 0
CLAIM AI_Model 1 1 1
CLAIM Backup_Daemon 2 0 1

REQUEST DB_Proc 1 0 0
REQUEST AI_Model 0 1 0
REQUEST Backup_Daemon 1 0 0

PRINT_STATE

# Deadlocking requests
REQUEST DB_Proc 0 1 0
REQUEST AI_Model 0 0 1
REQUEST Backup_Daemon 1 0 0

PRINT_STATE
CHECK_DEADLOCK

RECOVER

PRINT_STATE
CHECK_DEADLOCK
